                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>1. NCR and Shopper Costs are only available at Country level granularity.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>2. Only Actual data type is available at Non-country level granularity.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>3. Default Currency shows Local Currency. Use it only when selecting a single country or multiple countries with the same currency.</run>
