    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Read me'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/LS-PLReportOSData-Testing/Readme?rev=' id='Readme' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/LS-PLReportOSData-Testing' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='3100' maxwidth='1000' minheight='3100' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='15000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='2226'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Overall note</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Values are displayed in same format as Lucanet 1b GP by business lines view, considering on top:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>1. Additional Other Revenue lines:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   a. 70018500 Revenues - Sanctions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   b. 70019200 Revenue Subscription Vendor Subsidy - Incentives</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   c. 70021200 Revenue Subscription Vendor Subsidy - Delivery Fee</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2. 70014500 Revenues Advertisement Partnerships account for Peya NCR</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>3. Not considered Other Fees - OD LS /&amp; Other Fees - VDPU LS lines, and consider the - 70019500 Revenues - Service Fee OD and MP Local Store instead</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Actuals - How the logic works </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Step 1: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>For each of the relevant Revenue and Cost P&amp;L lines, Lucanet values are allocated to each order based on Allocation Keys available in Central Datahub. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Step 2: </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Order level values are aggregated at different granular levels to create the report. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Important notes: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  A. The Allocation Keys defined are expected to be the reasonable approximation of drivers of each line that we have available in Central Datahub. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  B. For this step to work properly, Lucanet and Datahub figures must be consistent. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  C. For the following metrics we could not identify a clear Allocation Key, hence these are displayed only at a country level in the report: </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>    a. Shopper Costs </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>    b.  Non Commission Revenue </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  D. Values are based on Lucanet FX rates and Monthly Reporting Segmentation w/o Hyperinflation. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='1' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='16097' id='5' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 203802.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='17226'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='5419' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='94323'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='22193' id='10' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 224419.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='33323'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='21903' id='11' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 224607.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='55516'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-right' value='2' />
              <format attr='margin-left' value='2' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16904' id='12' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='77419'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#434343' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Budget / Last Estimate / Month Estimate - How the logic works</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Values are available only at a Country level directly from Lucanet 1b Gross Profit by business lines view, with the following adjustments:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>1. Do not consider the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Other Fees - OD LS /&amp; Other Fees - VDPU LS </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>lines, and consider the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>- 70019500 Revenues - Service Fee OD and MP Local Store </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>instead, as part of Take-in.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2. Consider the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>70014500 Revenues Advertisement Partnerships </run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>account for Peya NCR.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Budget data levels:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2023: Budget Round 2023</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2024: Budget Round 2024 + Add Inv</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Last Estimate data level:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>The latest data level for projections available in Lucanet at the time of updating the report.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Month Estimate data levels:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>January: Budget</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>February: Budget</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>March: BE02</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>April: BE03</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>May: BE04</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>June: BE05</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>July: BE06</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>August: BE07</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>September: BE08</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>October: BE09</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>November: BE10</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>December: BE11</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='1968' id='17' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='258'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='12'>Full documentation in the link below</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CKwv6rCMTBbzlbiSP4nbqIIS29jERl8ArwnHliJVTDA/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CKwv6rCMTBbzlbiSP4nbqIIS29jERl8ArwnHliJVTDA/edit?usp=sharing</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='1150' minheight='1150' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='51' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='99484' id='50' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='258'>
                <zone h='1968' id='17' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='258'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Full documentation in the link below</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CKwv6rCMTBbzlbiSP4nbqIIS29jERl8ArwnHliJVTDA/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CKwv6rCMTBbzlbiSP4nbqIIS29jERl8ArwnHliJVTDA/edit?usp=sharing</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='15000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='2226'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Overall note</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Values are displayed in same format as Lucanet 1b GP by business lines view, considering on top:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>1. Additional Other Revenue lines:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   a. 70018500 Revenues - Sanctions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   b. 70019200 Revenue Subscription Vendor Subsidy - Incentives</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>   c. 70021200 Revenue Subscription Vendor Subsidy - Delivery Fee</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2. 70014500 Revenues Advertisement Partnerships account for Peya NCR</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>3. Not considered Other Fees - OD LS /&amp; Other Fees - VDPU LS lines, and consider the - 70019500 Revenues - Service Fee OD and MP Local Store instead</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Actuals - How the logic works </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Step 1: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>For each of the relevant Revenue and Cost P&amp;L lines, Lucanet values are allocated to each order based on Allocation Keys available in Central Datahub. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Step 2: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Order level values are aggregated at different granular levels to create the report. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Important notes: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  A. The Allocation Keys defined are expected to be the reasonable approximation of drivers of each line that we have available in Central Datahub. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  B. For this step to work properly, Lucanet and Datahub figures must be consistent. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  C. For the following metrics we could not identify a clear Allocation Key, hence these are displayed only at a country level in the report: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>    a. Shopper Costs </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>    b.  Non Commission Revenue </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>  D. Values are based on Lucanet FX rates and Monthly Reporting Segmentation w/o Hyperinflation. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='16097' id='5' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 203802.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='17226'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='22193' id='10' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 224419.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='33323'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='21903' id='11' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2024-03-28 224607.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='55516'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16904' id='12' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='77419'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#434343' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Budget / Last Estimate / Month Estimate - How the logic works</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Values are available only at a Country level directly from Lucanet 1b Gross Profit by business lines view, with the following adjustments:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>1. Do not consider the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>Other Fees - OD LS /&amp; Other Fees - VDPU LS </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>lines, and consider the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>- 70019500 Revenues - Service Fee OD and MP Local Store </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>instead, as part of Take-in.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2. Consider the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>70014500 Revenues Advertisement Partnerships </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>account for Peya NCR.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Budget data levels:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2023: Budget Round 2023</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>2024: Budget Round 2024 + Add Inv</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Last Estimate data level:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>The latest data level for projections available in Lucanet at the time of updating the report.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Month Estimate data levels:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>January: Budget</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>February: Budget</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>March: BE02</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>April: BE03</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>May: BE04</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>June: BE05</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>July: BE06</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>August: BE07</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>September: BE08</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>October: BE09</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>November: BE10</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Arial' fontsize='12'>December: BE11</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='5419' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='94323'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
