                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' underline='true'>Notes:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>1. NCR , Shopper Costs are only available at Country level granularity.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>2. EBITDA level calculations only available for Talabat and at Country level.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>3. Only Actual data type is available at Non-country level granularity.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>4. Default Currency shows Local Currency. Use it only when selecting a single country or multiple countries with the same currency.</run>
